<header class="profile" id="top">
  <div>
    <h1>王焱林 <span lang="en">Yanlin Wang</span></h1>
    <p>中山大学软件工程学院副教授、博士生导师</p>
    <p>聚焦大模型、智能体与可信人工智能，探索具备推理、记忆、工具使用和自主协作能力的新一代智能系统，应用场景为软件智能体、问答、具身智能等。</p>
    <p class="meta">本科毕业于浙江大学，在香港大学师从 Bruno C. d. S. Oliveira 教授，获计算机科学博士学位。2019 至 2022 年在微软亚洲研究院工作，合作导师为<a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/dongmeiz/">张冬梅</a>和<a href="https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/shihan/">韩石</a>。2022 年加入中山大学软件工程学院。</p>
    <p class="contact"><a href="mailto:wangylin36@mail.sysu.edu.cn">wangylin36@mail.sysu.edu.cn</a> · <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=en&amp;user=xSCoImAAAAAJ">Google Scholar</a> · <a href="https://sse.sysu.edu.cn/teacher/329">学院主页</a></p>
  </div>
  <img src="pic/bio2.png" width="806" height="462" alt="王焱林近照" />
</header>

<section class="section-block" id="research">
  <h2>研究方向</h2>
  <details class="research-theme" id="agents">
    <summary>大模型智能体与自主学习</summary>
    <div class="subtopics">
      <h3>智能体的记忆、协作与软件修复</h3>
      <p>一个软件问题可能需要多轮尝试才能解决。我们研究智能体怎样保留有用的经验、在定位和修复缺陷时分工，以及一种修复策略失效后如何尝试另一种策略。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.10250">MemoryBank: Enhancing Large Language Models with Long-Term Memory</a> <small>(AAAI 2024)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://proceedings.neurips.cc/paper_files/paper/2024/hash/5d1f02132ef51602adf07000ca5b6138-Abstract-Conference.html">MAGIS: LLM-Based Multi-Agent Framework for GitHub Issue Resolution</a> <small>(NeurIPS 2024)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18859">PhoenixRepair: Rethinking Repair Strategy Exploration in Software Agents</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
      <h3>仓库级代码生成与上下文检索</h3>
      <p>补全一行代码所需的信息可能藏在另一个文件里。我们研究如何根据补全意图选择上下文，在关键 token 处触发检索，以及如何降低长代码的计算开销。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.19487">RLCoder: Reinforcement Learning for Repository-Level Code Completion</a> <small>(ICSE 2025)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/34/AlignCoder-Aligning-Retrieval-with-Target-Intent-for-Repository-Level-Code-Completio">AlignCoder: Aligning Retrieval with Target Intent for Repository-Level Code Completion</a> <small>(ASE 2025)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1189/">From Logical to Computational Sparsity: Structure-Aware Block-Sparse Attention for Long-Code Completion</a> <small>(ACL 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01601">Adaptive Critical Token-Aware Retrieval for Repository-Level Code Generation</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
      <h3>从任务与执行轨迹中学习</h3>
      <p>训练软件智能体，首先要把仓库中的问题变成可以运行和验证的任务。得到执行记录后，我们进一步研究哪些轨迹和步骤值得让智能体学习。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3797119">SWE Data Construction, Automatically!</a> <small>(FSE 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27449">SWE-Prime: Fewer Trajectories, Better Performance</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="research-theme" id="trustworthy-models">
    <summary>大模型训练、评测与可信安全</summary>
    <div class="subtopics">
      <h3>代码表示、训练数据与学习过程</h3>
      <p>源代码、语法结构与自然语言注释可以提供不同的训练信号。我们也研究如何重建代码预训练数据，以及如何让教师模型逐步增加训练问题的难度。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2022.acl-long.499/">UniXcoder: Unified Cross-Modal Pre-training for Code Representation</a> <small>(ACL 2022)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2401.15670">YODA: Teacher-Student Progressive Learning for Language Models</a> <small>(arXiv 2024)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.19444">Large Language Models are Qualified Benchmark Builders: Rebuilding Pre-Training Datasets for Advancing Code Intelligence Tasks</a> <small>(ICPC 2025)</small></li>
      </ul>
      <h3>从能力测评到过程评估</h3>
      <p>从人类考试题到跨文件推理和多轮代码评审，任务对模型的要求各不相同。我们设计相应的评测，也研究能否利用智能体的执行轨迹降低评测成本。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2024.findings-naacl.149/">AGIEval: A Human-Centric Benchmark for Evaluating Foundation Models</a> <small>(Findings of NAACL 2024)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3808131">RepoReasoner: Evaluating Repository-Level Code Reasoning Ability of Long-Context Language Models</a> <small>(FSE 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27442">From Static to Dynamic: Benchmarking Real-World Code Review with MCR-Bench</a> <small>(ISSTA 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01603">Efficient SWE Agent Benchmarking via Trajectory-Aware Evaluation</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
      <h3>生成代码的可靠性与安全性</h3>
      <p>通过测试的补丁仍可能遗漏评审要求、偏离项目风格，或引入安全问题。我们分析这些缺陷和代码幻觉在真实开发场景中怎样出现，以及怎样在评测中发现它们。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2409.20550">LLM Hallucinations in Practical Code Generation: Phenomena, Mechanism, and Mitigation</a> <small>(ISSTA 2025)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.00456">Beyond Functional Correctness: Investigating Coding Style Inconsistencies in Large Language Models</a> <small>(FSE 2025)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1786/">RealSec-bench: A Benchmark for Evaluating Secure Code Generation in Real-World Repositories</a> <small>(Findings of ACL 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.04167">SWE-Gate: Passing Functional Tests Is Not Enough for Software Engineering Agents</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
  <details class="research-theme" id="embodied-science">
    <summary>具身智能与 AI4Science</summary>
    <div class="subtopics">
      <h3>视觉证据与多模态推理</h3>
      <p>智能体要根据环境调整行动，需要在推理时持续利用观测信息。VGPO 研究模型如何在多步推理中保留图像线索；OmniGIRL 则用带图的 GitHub 问题检验软件智能体是否能用上这些证据。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.301/">Visually-Guided Policy Optimization for Multimodal Reasoning</a> <small>(ACL 2026)</small></li>
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04606">OmniGIRL: A Multilingual and Multimodal Benchmark for GitHub Issue Resolution</a> <small>(ISSTA 2025)</small></li>
      </ul>
      <h3>实验反馈与自主决策</h3>
      <p>智能体能否根据一次实验的结果修正假设、选择下一步实验？我们从模型训练实验入手，在 RSI-Prime 中标注实验轨迹里的具体决策。将这类学习方法用于具身交互和科学实验，是我们希望继续探索的问题。</p>
      <ul class="research-papers" lang="en">
        <li><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.23138">RSI-Prime: Training Models to Train Models</a> <small>(arXiv 2026)</small></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<section class="section-block" id="news">
  <h2>近期动态</h2>
  <ul class="news-list">
    <li><time datetime="2026-11">2026-11</time> <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.23138">RSI-Prime</a> 预印本发布。数据集记录了七类任务的 350 条训练实验轨迹，用于研究模型如何从实验决策中学习。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09">2026-09</time> 软件智能体系列工作围绕<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.04167">代码评审约束</a>、<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01603">轨迹感知评测</a>、<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27449">训练轨迹选择</a>和<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.18859">修复策略探索</a>展开。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-09">2026-09</time> <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.01601">ACToR</a> 研究仓库级代码生成应当检索哪些上下文。<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27442">MCR-Bench</a> 研究多轮代码评审，获 ISSTA 2026 录用。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-07">2026-07</time> <strong>智能体与仓库级推理：</strong>关于<a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3797119">智能体数据自动构建</a>和<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.25996">仓库级代码推理</a>的两项工作发表于 FSE 2026。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-07">2026-07</time> <strong>代码大模型：</strong>四项 ACL 2026 工作研究<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.1189/">高效长代码补全</a>、<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.969/">面向鸿蒙的仓库级代码补全</a>、<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1786/">安全代码生成</a>与<a href="https://aclanthology.org/2026.findings-acl.1877/">开发知识评测</a>。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2026-04">2026-04</time> 三项发表于 ICSE 2026 的工作分别研究<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/182/What-to-Retrieve-for-Effective-Retrieval-Augmented-Code-Generation-An-Empirical-Stud">代码生成中的上下文检索</a>、<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/229/Top-General-Performance-Top-Domain-Performance-DomainCodeBench-A-Multi-domain-Cod">跨领域代码生成评测</a>和<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/icse-2026/icse-2026-research-track/241/Knowledge-Matters-Injecting-Project-and-Testing-Knowledge-into-LLM-based-Unit-Test-G">利用项目与测试知识生成单元测试</a>。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2025-12">2025-12</time> 我们发布了关于<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.01939">开发者如何使用智能体框架</a>的实证研究。另两项工作分别用测试验证<a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/TSE.2025.3631886">代码搜索结果</a>和评测<a href="https://doi.org/10.1109/TSE.2025.3645056">仓库级代码翻译</a>。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2025-11">2025-11</time> 三项发表于 ASE 2025 的工作聚焦仓库级代码智能，分别研究<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/34/AlignCoder-Aligning-Retrieval-with-Target-Intent-for-Repository-Level-Code-Completio">面向补全意图的检索</a>、<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/149/DrainCode-Stealthy-Energy-Consumption-Attacks-on-Retrieval-Augmented-Code-Generation">检索上下文投毒的能耗风险</a>和<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/ase-2025/ase-2025-papers/143/RustRepoTrans-Repository-level-Context-Code-Translation-Benchmark-Targeting-Rust">面向 Rust 的仓库级代码翻译</a>。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2025-06">2025-06</time> 在 ISSTA 和 FSE 2025 发表的工作研究<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.04606">多语言、多模态的 GitHub 问题解决</a>、<a href="https://conf.researchr.org/details/issta-2025/issta-2025-papers/22/LLM-Hallucinations-in-Practical-Code-Generation-Phenomena-Mechanism-and-Mitigation">实际代码生成中的幻觉</a>，以及<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.00456">生成代码的风格一致性</a>。</li>
    <li><time datetime="2025-04">2025-04</time> 发布关于<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.08734">代码智能中上下文利用</a>的系统性研究。另一项关于<a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.19444">用大模型重建代码预训练数据集</a>的工作获 ICPC 2025 的 ACM SIGSOFT 杰出论文奖。</li>
  </ul>
